<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's IGB 6-mth net jumps fourfold.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's IGB 6-mth net jumps fourfold.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  91.65   vs	  19.63</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 19.4    vs	   4.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   489.15   vs	 274.87</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   109.28   vs	  27.93</p>
<p>    Minorities	    add  0.25   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    7.00		 11.44</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)	5.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's IGB Corp Bhd is a property development and construction concern.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
